#, no-wrap
msgid "Show help for the footprint upgrade command."
msgstr "显示封装升级命令的帮助信息。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:159
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The output directory for the upgraded footprints. When `--output` is\n"
"      not used, the upgraded footprints are saved over the original footprints."
msgstr "升级后的封装的输出目录。当未使用 `--output` 时，升级后的封装将覆盖原始封装。"

