"      It can also be found in the `.kicad_jobset` file under the output's `id`\n"
"      key."
msgstr "要生成的作业集输出。如果未指定输出，则将生成所有输出。输出通过唯一标识符进行指定。当未使用 `--output` 选项时，每个输出的标识符将由 `jobset run` 命令打印。该标识符还可在 `.kicad_jobset` 文件的输出 `id` 键下找到。"

#. type: Title ==
#: cli.adoc:197
#, no-wrap
msgid "PCB commands"
msgstr "PCB 命令"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:201
msgid "The `pcb` command runs a design rule check or exports a board to various other file formats, including fabrication and 3D files."
msgstr "`pcb` 命令用于执行设计规则检查或将电路板导出为多种其他文件格式，包括制造文件和 3D 文件。"

#. type: Title ===
#: cli.adoc:202
#, no-wrap
msgid "PCB DRC"
msgstr "PCB DRC"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:205
msgid "The `pcb drc` command runs a design rule check on a board and generates a report."
msgstr "`pcb drc` 命令对电路板执行设计规则检查并生成报告。"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:207
msgid ""
"Usage: `kicad-cli pcb drc [--help] [--output OUTPUT_FILE] [--define-var KEY=VALUE] [--format FORMAT] [--all-track-errors] [--schematic-parity] [--units UNITS] [--severity-all] [--severity-error] [--severity-warning] [--severity-exclusions] [--exit-code-"
"violations] INPUT_FILE`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:214
#, no-wrap
msgid "Board file to run DRC on."
msgstr "用于运行 DRC 的电路板文件。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:220
#, no-wrap
msgid "Show help for the DRC command."
msgstr "显示 DRC 命令的帮助信息。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:221 cli.adoc:1670
#, no-wrap
msgid "`-o <output filename>, `--output <output filename>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:224
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Output filename for the generated DRC report. When `--output` is not\n"
"      used, the output filename will be the same as the input file, with the\n"
"      `.rpt` or `.json` file extension, depending on the selected format."
msgstr "生成的 DRC 报告的输出文件名。当未使用 `--output` 时，输出文件名将与输入文件相同，文件扩展名根据所选格式不同，分别为 `.rpt` 或 `.json`。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:228 cli.adoc:356 cli.adoc:1080 cli.adoc:1677 cli.adoc:2123
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--format <format>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:229 cli.adoc:1678
#, no-wrap
msgid "Report file format. Options are `report` (default) or `json`."
msgstr "报告文件格式。可选格式为 `report`（默认）或 `json`。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:230
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--all-track-errors`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:231
#, no-wrap
msgid "Report all errors for each track."
msgstr "为每条布线报告所有错误。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:232
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--schematic-parity`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:233
#, no-wrap
msgid "Test for parity between PCB and schematic."
msgstr "检查 PCB 与原理图之间的对齐情况。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:234 cli.adoc:877 cli.adoc:1083 cli.adoc:1679
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--units <unit>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:235 cli.adoc:1680
#, no-wrap
msgid "Units to use in the report. Options are `mm` (default), `in`, or `mils`."
msgstr "报告中使用的单位。可选单位包括 `mm`（默认）、`in` 或 `mils`。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:236 cli.adoc:1681
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--severity-all`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:238
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Report all DRC violations. This is equivalent to using all of the other\n"
"      DRC severity options."
msgstr "报告所有 DRC 违规行为。这相当于使用所有其他 DRC 严重性选项。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:239 cli.adoc:1684
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--severity-error`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:241
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Report all error-level DRC violations. This can be combined with the other\n"
"      DRC severity options."
msgstr "报告所有错误级别的 DRC 违规项。此选项可与其他 DRC 严重性选项结合使用。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:242 cli.adoc:1687
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--severity-warning`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:244
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Report all warning-level DRC violations. This can be combined with the\n"
"      other DRC severity options."
msgstr "报告所有警告级别的 DRC 违规。这可以与其他 DRC 严重性选项结合使用。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:245 cli.adoc:1690
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--severity-exclusions`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:247
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Report all excluded DRC violations. This can be combined with the other\n"
"      DRC severity options."
msgstr "报告所有被排除的 DRC 违规行为。这可以与其他 DRC 严重性选项结合使用。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:248 cli.adoc:1693
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--exit-code-violations`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:251
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Return an exit code depending on whether or not DRC violations exist. The\n"
"      exit code is 0 if no violations are found, and 5 if any violations are\n"
"      found."
msgstr "根据是否存在 DRC 违规情况返回退出代码。如果未发现任何违规，退出代码为 0；如果发现任何违规，退出代码为 5。"

#. type: Title ===
#: cli.adoc:253
#, no-wrap
msgid "PCB BREP (OCCT) export"
msgstr "PCB BREP (OCCT) 导出"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:257
msgid "The `pcb export brep` command exports a board design to a BREP (OCCT-native boundary representation) 3D model file."
msgstr "`pcb export brep` 命令将电路板设计导出为 BREP（OCCT 原生边界表示）3D 模型文件。"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:259
msgid ""
"Usage: `kicad-cli pcb export brep [--help] [--output OUTPUT_FILE] [--define-var KEY=VALUE] [--force] [--no-unspecified] [--no-dnp] [--grid-origin] [--drill-origin] [--subst-models] [--board-only] [--cut-vias-in-body] [--no-board-body] [--no-components] [--"
"component-filter VAR] [--include-tracks] [--include-pads] [--include-zones] [--include-inner-copper] [--include-silkscreen] [--include-soldermask] [--fuse-shapes] [--fill-all-vias] [--min-distance MIN_DIST] [--net-filter VAR] [--user-origin VAR] INPUT_FILE`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:266 cli.adoc:344 cli.adoc:402 cli.adoc:486 cli.adoc:531 cli.adoc:623 cli.adoc:695 cli.adoc:771 cli.adoc:828 cli.adoc:853 cli.adoc:892 cli.adoc:986 cli.adoc:1065 cli.adoc:1115 cli.adoc:1209 cli.adoc:1291 cli.adoc:1369 cli.adoc:1459 cli.adoc:1506
#, no-wrap
msgid "Board file to export."
msgstr "导出电路板文件。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:274
#, no-wrap
msgid "Show help for the BREP export command."
msgstr "显示 BREP 导出命令的帮助信息。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:275 cli.adoc:495 cli.adoc:632 cli.adoc:704 cli.adoc:780 cli.adoc:837 cli.adoc:864 cli.adoc:995 cli.adoc:1074 cli.adoc:1218 cli.adoc:1300 cli.adoc:1468 cli.adoc:1515 cli.adoc:1593 cli.adoc:1726 cli.adoc:1837 cli.adoc:1866 cli.adoc:1970 cli.adoc:2101
#, no-wrap
msgid "`-o <output filename>`, `--output <output filename>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:277
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The output filename. When `--output` is not used, the output filename\n"
"      will be the same as the input file, with the `.brep` file extension."
msgstr "输出文件名。当未使用 `--output` 时，输出文件名将与输入文件相同，并带有 `.brep` 文件扩展名。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:281 cli.adoc:710 cli.adoc:1001 cli.adoc:1224 cli.adoc:1306 cli.adoc:1474 cli.adoc:1521
#, no-wrap
msgid "`-f`, `--force`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:282 cli.adoc:711 cli.adoc:1002 cli.adoc:1225 cli.adoc:1307 cli.adoc:1475 cli.adoc:1522
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overwrite output file."
msgstr "覆盖输出文件。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:283 cli.adoc:712 cli.adoc:1003 cli.adoc:1226 cli.adoc:1308 cli.adoc:1476 cli.adoc:1523
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--no-unspecified`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:284 cli.adoc:713 cli.adoc:1004 cli.adoc:1227 cli.adoc:1309 cli.adoc:1477 cli.adoc:1524
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exclude 3D models of components with \"unspecified\" footprint type."
msgstr "排除具有 “未指定” 封装类型的元件的 3D 模型。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:285 cli.adoc:714 cli.adoc:1005 cli.adoc:1228 cli.adoc:1310 cli.adoc:1478 cli.adoc:1525
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--no-dnp`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:286 cli.adoc:715 cli.adoc:1006 cli.adoc:1229 cli.adoc:1311 cli.adoc:1479 cli.adoc:1526
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exclude 3D models of components with \"Do not populate\" attribute."
msgstr "排除具有 “DNP” 属性的元件的 3D 模型。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:287 cli.adoc:716 cli.adoc:1007 cli.adoc:1230 cli.adoc:1312 cli.adoc:1527
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--grid-origin`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:288 cli.adoc:717 cli.adoc:1008 cli.adoc:1231 cli.adoc:1313 cli.adoc:1528
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use grid origin as origin of output file."
msgstr "将网格原点作为输出文件的原点。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:289 cli.adoc:718 cli.adoc:1009 cli.adoc:1232 cli.adoc:1314 cli.adoc:1529
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--drill-origin`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:290 cli.adoc:719 cli.adoc:1010 cli.adoc:1233 cli.adoc:1315 cli.adoc:1530
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use drill origin as origin of output file."
msgstr "将钻孔原点作为输出文件的原点。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:291 cli.adoc:720 cli.adoc:1011 cli.adoc:1234 cli.adoc:1316 cli.adoc:1531
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--subst-models`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:293 cli.adoc:1013 cli.adoc:1236 cli.adoc:1318 cli.adoc:1533
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Replace VRML models in footprints with STEP or IGS models of the same\n"
"      name, if they exist."
msgstr "如果存在同名的 STEP 或 IGS 模型，则用它们替换封装中的 VRML 模型。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:294 cli.adoc:723 cli.adoc:1014 cli.adoc:1237 cli.adoc:1319 cli.adoc:1534
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--board-only`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:296 cli.adoc:725 cli.adoc:1016 cli.adoc:1239 cli.adoc:1321 cli.adoc:1536
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Only include the board itself in the generated model; exclude all\n"
"      component models."
msgstr "仅将电路板本身包含在生成的模型中；排除所有元件模型。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:297 cli.adoc:726 cli.adoc:1017 cli.adoc:1240 cli.adoc:1322 cli.adoc:1537
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--cut-vias-in-body`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:298 cli.adoc:727 cli.adoc:1018 cli.adoc:1241 cli.adoc:1323 cli.adoc:1538
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cut via holes in board body even if conductor layers are not exported."
msgstr "即使导电层未导出，仍需在电路板本体上开孔。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:299 cli.adoc:728 cli.adoc:1019 cli.adoc:1242 cli.adoc:1324 cli.adoc:1539
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--no-board-body`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:300 cli.adoc:729 cli.adoc:1020 cli.adoc:1243 cli.adoc:1325 cli.adoc:1540
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exclude board body."
msgstr "排除电路板主体。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:301 cli.adoc:730 cli.adoc:1021 cli.adoc:1244 cli.adoc:1326 cli.adoc:1541
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--no-components`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:302 cli.adoc:731 cli.adoc:1022 cli.adoc:1245 cli.adoc:1327 cli.adoc:1542
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exclude 3D models for components."
msgstr "排除元件的 3D 模型。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:303 cli.adoc:732 cli.adoc:1023 cli.adoc:1246 cli.adoc:1328 cli.adoc:1543
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--component-filter <reference designator list>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:305 cli.adoc:734 cli.adoc:1025 cli.adoc:1248 cli.adoc:1330 cli.adoc:1545
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Only include component 3D models matching this list of reference\n"
"      designators (comma-separated, wildcards supported)"
msgstr "仅包含与以下位号列表匹配的元件 3D 模型（以逗号分隔，支持通配符）"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:306 cli.adoc:735 cli.adoc:1026 cli.adoc:1249 cli.adoc:1331 cli.adoc:1546
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--include-tracks`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:307 cli.adoc:736 cli.adoc:1027 cli.adoc:1250 cli.adoc:1332 cli.adoc:1547
#, no-wrap
msgid "Include tracks and vias on outer conductor layers in export (time consuming)."
msgstr "在导出时包含外层导电层上的布线和过孔（耗时）。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:308 cli.adoc:737 cli.adoc:1028 cli.adoc:1251 cli.adoc:1333 cli.adoc:1548
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--include-pads`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:309 cli.adoc:738 cli.adoc:1029 cli.adoc:1252 cli.adoc:1334 cli.adoc:1549
#, no-wrap
msgid "Include pads in export (time consuming)."
msgstr "在导出时包含焊盘（耗时）。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:310 cli.adoc:739 cli.adoc:1030 cli.adoc:1253 cli.adoc:1335 cli.adoc:1550
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--include-zones`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:311 cli.adoc:740 cli.adoc:1031 cli.adoc:1254 cli.adoc:1336 cli.adoc:1551
#, no-wrap
msgid "Include zones in export (time consuming)."
msgstr "在导出时包含敷铜（耗时）。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:312 cli.adoc:741 cli.adoc:1032 cli.adoc:1255 cli.adoc:1337 cli.adoc:1552
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--include-inner-copper`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:313 cli.adoc:742 cli.adoc:1033 cli.adoc:1256 cli.adoc:1338 cli.adoc:1553
#, no-wrap
msgid "Include elements on inner conductor layers in export."
msgstr "在导出时包含内导体层中的元素。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:314 cli.adoc:743 cli.adoc:1034 cli.adoc:1257 cli.adoc:1339 cli.adoc:1554
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--include-silkscreen`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:315 cli.adoc:744 cli.adoc:1035 cli.adoc:1258 cli.adoc:1340 cli.adoc:1555
#, no-wrap
msgid "Include silkscreen graphics in export as a set of flat faces."
msgstr "在导出时将丝印图形作为一组平面图形包含在内。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:316 cli.adoc:745 cli.adoc:1036 cli.adoc:1259 cli.adoc:1341 cli.adoc:1556
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--include-soldermask`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:317 cli.adoc:746 cli.adoc:1037 cli.adoc:1260 cli.adoc:1342 cli.adoc:1557
#, no-wrap
msgid "Include solder mask layers in export as a set of flat faces."
msgstr "在导出时将阻焊层作为一组平面。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:318 cli.adoc:747 cli.adoc:1038 cli.adoc:1261 cli.adoc:1343 cli.adoc:1558
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--fuse-shapes`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:319 cli.adoc:748 cli.adoc:1039 cli.adoc:1262 cli.adoc:1344 cli.adoc:1559
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fuse overlapping geometry together in export (time consuming)."
msgstr "在导出时将重叠的几何体合并在一起（耗时）。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:320 cli.adoc:749 cli.adoc:1040 cli.adoc:1263 cli.adoc:1345 cli.adoc:1560
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--fill-all-vias`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:321 cli.adoc:750 cli.adoc:1041 cli.adoc:1264 cli.adoc:1346 cli.adoc:1561
#, no-wrap
msgid "Don't cut via holes in conductor layers."
msgstr "请勿通过导电层上的过孔进行切割。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:322 cli.adoc:751 cli.adoc:1042 cli.adoc:1265 cli.adoc:1347 cli.adoc:1562
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--min-distance <min distance>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:324 cli.adoc:753 cli.adoc:1044 cli.adoc:1267 cli.adoc:1349 cli.adoc:1564
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Tolerance for considering two points to be in the same location. Default:\n"
"      `0.01mm`."
msgstr "将两个点视为位于同一位置的误差。默认值：`0.01mm`。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:325 cli.adoc:754 cli.adoc:1045 cli.adoc:1268 cli.adoc:1350 cli.adoc:1565
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--net-filter <net filter>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:326 cli.adoc:755 cli.adoc:1046 cli.adoc:1269 cli.adoc:1351 cli.adoc:1566
#, no-wrap
msgid "Only include copper items belonging to nets matching this wildcard."
msgstr "仅包含与该通配符匹配的网络中的铜对象。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:327 cli.adoc:756 cli.adoc:1047 cli.adoc:1274 cli.adoc:1352 cli.adoc:1480 cli.adoc:1567
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--user-origin <output origin>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:330 cli.adoc:759 cli.adoc:1050 cli.adoc:1277 cli.adoc:1355 cli.adoc:1570
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Specify a custom origin for the output file, with X and Y coordinates. For\n"
"      example, `1x1in`, `1x1inch`, or `25.4x25.4mm`. The default unit is\n"
"      millimeters."
msgstr "指定输出文件的自定义原点，包括 X 和 Y 坐标。例如，`1x1in`、`1x1inch` 或 `25.4x25.4mm`。默认单位为毫米。"

#. type: Title ===
#: cli.adoc:332
#, no-wrap
msgid "PCB drill file export"
msgstr "PCB 钻孔文件导出"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:335
msgid "The `pcb export drill` command exports a drill file from a board."
msgstr "`pcb export drill` 命令从电路板导出钻孔文件。"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:337
msgid ""
"Usage: `kicad-cli pcb export drill [--help] [--output OUTPUT_DIR] [--format FORMAT] [--drill-origin DRILL_ORIGIN] [--excellon-zeros-format ZEROS_FORMAT] [--excellon-oval-format OVAL_FORMAT] [--excellon-units UNITS] [--excellon-mirror-y] [--excellon-min-"
"header] [--excellon-separate-th] [--generate-map] [--map-format MAP_FORMAT] [--gerber-precision VAR] INPUT_FILE`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:352
#, no-wrap
msgid "Show help for the drill file export command."
msgstr "显示钻孔文件导出命令的帮助信息。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:355
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The output directory for the drill file(s). When `--output` is not\n"
"      used, the drill file(s) are saved in the current directory."
msgstr "钻孔文件的输出目录。当未使用 `--output` 时，钻孔文件将保存在当前目录中。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:357
#, no-wrap
msgid "The drill file format. Options are `excellon` (default) or `gerber`."
msgstr "钻孔文件格式。可选格式为 `excellon`（默认）或 `gerber`。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:358
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--drill-origin <origin>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:361
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The coordinate origin for the drill file. Options are `absolute` (default)\n"
"      to use the board's absolute origin or `plot` to use the board's\n"
"      drill/placement origin."
msgstr "钻孔文件的坐标原点。可选项包括 `absolute`（默认）使用电路板的绝对原点，或 `plot` 使用电路板的钻孔/布局原点。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:362
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--excellon-zeros-format <format>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:365
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The zeros format for the drill file. Options are `decimal` (default),\n"
"      `suppressleading`, `suppresstrailing`, or `keep`. Only applies to Excellon\n"
"      format drill files."
msgstr "钻孔文件的零导格式。可选项包括 `decimal`（默认十进制）、`suppressleading`（抑制前导）、`suppresstrailing`（抑制后导） 或 `keep`。仅适用于 Excellon 格式钻孔文件。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:366
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--excellon-oval-format <format>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:368
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Control the oval holes drill mode. Options are `route` and `alternate`\n"
"    (default). Only applies to Excellon format drill files."
msgstr "控制椭圆形孔的钻孔模式。可选模式为 `route` 和 `alternate`（默认）。仅适用于 Excellon 格式的钻孔文件。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:369
#, no-wrap
msgid "`-u <units>`, `--excellon-units <units>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:371
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The units for the drill file. Options are `mm` (default) or `in`. Only\n"
"      applies to Excellon format drill files."
msgstr "钻孔文件的单位。可选单位为 `mm`（默认）或 `in`。仅适用于 Excellon 格式钻孔文件。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:372
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--excellon-mirror-y`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:374
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Mirror the drill file in the Y direction. Only applies to Excellon format\n"
"      drill files."
msgstr "将钻孔文件在 Y 方向上镜像。仅适用于 Excellon 格式的钻孔文件。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:375
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--excellon-min-header`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:377
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use a minimal header in the drill file. Only applies to Excellon format\n"
"      drill files."
msgstr "在钻孔文件中使用最小的钻头。仅适用于 Excellon 格式的钻孔文件。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:378
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--excellon-separate-th`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:380
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Generate separate drill files for plated and non-plated through holes.\n"
"      Only applies to Excellon format drill files."
msgstr "为电镀孔和非电镀孔分别生成钻孔文件。 仅适用于 Excellon 格式的钻孔文件。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:381
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--generate-map`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:382
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generate a map file in addition to the drill file."
msgstr "除了钻孔文件外，还生成一个映射文件。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:383
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--map-format <format>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:385
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The map file format. Options are `pdf` (default), `gerberx2`, `ps`, `dxf`,\n"
"      or `svg`."
msgstr "映射文件格式。可选格式包括 `pdf`（默认）、`gerberx2`、`ps`、`dxf` 或 `svg`。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:386
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--gerber-precision <precision>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:388
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The precision (number of digits) for the drill file. Valid options are `5`\n"
"      or `6` (default).  Only applies to Gerber format drill files."
msgstr "钻孔文件的精度（位数）。有效选项为 `5` 或 `6`（默认值）。仅适用于 Gerber 格式的钻孔文件。"

#. type: Title ===
#: cli.adoc:390
#, no-wrap
msgid "PCB DXF export"
msgstr "PCB DXF 导出"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:393
msgid "The `pcb export dxf` command exports a board design to a DXF file."
msgstr "`pcb export dxf` 命令将电路板设计导出为 DXF 文件。"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:395
msgid ""
"Usage: `kicad-cli pcb export dxf [--help] [--output OUTPUT_DIR] [--layers LAYER_LIST] [--drawing-sheet SHEET_PATH] [--define-var KEY=VALUE] [--exclude-refdes] [--exclude-value] [--sketch-pads-on-fab-layers] [--hide-DNP-footprints-on-fab-layers] [--sketch-DNP-"
"footprints-on-fab-layers] [--crossout-DNP-footprints-on-fab-layers] [--subtract-soldermask] [--use-contours] [--use-drill-origin] [--include-border-title] [--output-units UNITS] [--drill-shape-opt VAR] [--common-layers COMMON_LAYER_LIST] [--mode-single] [--"
"mode-multi] [--plot-invisible-text] [--scale SCALE] INPUT_FILE`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:410 cli.adoc:494
#, no-wrap
msgid "Show help for the DXF export command."
msgstr "显示 DXF 导出命令的帮助信息。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:417 cli.adoc:1130 cli.adoc:1384
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The output folder or filename for the exported files. When `--mode-single`\n"
"      is used, this is the output filename. If `--output` is not used, the\n"
"      output filename will be the same as the input\n"
"      file, with the `.pdf` file extension. When `--mode-multi` is used, this is\n"
"      the output directory. If `--output` is not used, the files are exported\n"
"      to the current directory."
msgstr "导出文件的输出文件夹或文件名。当使用 `--mode-single` 时，此为输出文件名。如果未使用 `--output`，输出文件名将与输入文件相同，并带有 `.pdf` 文件扩展名。当使用 `--mode-multi` 时，此为输出目录。如果未使用 `--output`，文件将导出到当前目录。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:423
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A comma-separated list of layer names to export from the footprint, such\n"
"      as `F.Cu,B.Cu`. At least one layer must be given. Layer names can be\n"
"      specified as canonical layer names (`F.Cu`, `In.1`, `F.Fab`, etc.) or as\n"
"      user-defined (custom) layer names, but user-defined layer names are matched\n"
"      first."
msgstr "从封装中导出的图层名称列表，以逗号分隔，例如 `F.Cu,B.Cu`。必须至少指定一个图层。图层名称可以指定为规范图层名称（如 `F.Cu`、`In.1`、`F.Fab` 等）或用户自定义（自定义）图层名称，但优先匹配用户自定义图层名称。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:424 cli.adoc:551 cli.adoc:641 cli.adoc:783 cli.adoc:866 cli.adoc:914 cli.adoc:1143 cli.adoc:1391 cli.adoc:1794 cli.adoc:1869 cli.adoc:1923 cli.adoc:2000
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--drawing-sheet <sheet path>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:426 cli.adoc:553 cli.adoc:643 cli.adoc:785 cli.adoc:868 cli.adoc:916 cli.adoc:1145 cli.adoc:1393
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Path to drawing sheet to use in plot, overriding the drawing sheet\n"
"      specified in the board file."
msgstr "用于绘制的图纸路径，覆盖板文件中指定的图纸。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:430 cli.adoc:557 cli.adoc:647 cli.adoc:922 cli.adoc:1151
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--erd`, `--exclude-refdes`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:431 cli.adoc:558 cli.adoc:648 cli.adoc:923 cli.adoc:1152
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exclude footprint reference designators from plot."
msgstr "从绘制中排除封装位号。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:432 cli.adoc:559 cli.adoc:649 cli.adoc:924 cli.adoc:1153
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--ev`, `--exclude-value`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:433 cli.adoc:560 cli.adoc:650 cli.adoc:925 cli.adoc:1154
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exclude footprint values from plot."
msgstr "从绘制中排除封装值。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:442 cli.adoc:575 cli.adoc:665 cli.adoc:928 cli.adoc:1157 cli.adoc:1397
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--subtract-soldermask`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:443 cli.adoc:576 cli.adoc:666 cli.adoc:929 cli.adoc:1158 cli.adoc:1398
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remove silkscreen from areas without soldermask."
msgstr "从没有阻焊层的区域去除丝印。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:444
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--uc`, `--use-contours`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:445
#, no-wrap
msgid "Plot graphic items using their contours."
msgstr "使用轮廓绘制图形对象。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:446
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--udo`, `--use-drill-origin`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:447
#, no-wrap
msgid "Plot using the drill/place file origin."
msgstr "使用钻孔/放置文件的原点进行绘制。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:448
#, no-wrap
msgid "`-ibt`, `--include-border-title`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:449
#, no-wrap
msgid "Include sheet border and title block in plot."
msgstr "在绘制中包含图纸边框和标题栏。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:450
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--ou <unit>`, `--output-units <unit>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:451
#, no-wrap
msgid "Output units. Options are `mm` or `in` (default)."
msgstr "输出单位。可选单位为 `mm` 或 `in`（默认）。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:452
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--drill-shape-opt <shape>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:454 cli.adoc:947 cli.adoc:1176 cli.adoc:1427
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The shape of drill marks in the plot. Options are `0` for no drill marks,\n"
"      `1` for small marks, or `2` for actual size marks (default)."
msgstr "钻孔标记在图中的形状。选项包括：`0` 表示不显示钻孔标记，`1` 表示显示小标记，或 `2` 表示显示实际大小的标记（默认）。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:455 cli.adoc:591 cli.adoc:948 cli.adoc:1137 cli.adoc:1428
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--cl <layer list>`, `--common-layers <layer list>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:459 cli.adoc:952 cli.adoc:1432
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A comma-separated list of layer names to plot on all layers, such as\n"
"      `F.Cu,B.Cu`. Layer names can be specified as canonical layer names\n"
"      (`F.Cu`, `In.1`, `F.Fab`, etc.) or as user-defined (custom) layer names,\n"
"      but user-defined layer names are matched first."
msgstr "在所有图层上绘制的图层名称的逗号分隔列表，例如 `F.Cu,B.Cu`。图层名称可以指定为规范图层名称（如 `F.Cu`、`In.1`、`F.Fab` 等）或用户自定义（自定义）图层名称，但优先匹配用户定义的图层名称。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:460 cli.adoc:957 cli.adoc:1177 cli.adoc:1433
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--mode-single`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:461 cli.adoc:1178 cli.adoc:1434
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generates a single file with the output arg path acting as the complete directory and filename path. `COMMON_LAYER_LIST` does not function in this mode. Instead `LAYER_LIST` controls all layers plotted."
msgstr "生成一个单一文件，其中输出参数路径作为完整的目录和文件名路径。`COMMON_LAYER_LIST` 在此模式下不生效。相反，`LAYER_LIST` 控制所有绘制的图层。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:462 cli.adoc:1435
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--mode-multi`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:465
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Plot the layers to one or more DXF files, with each file representing a\n"
"      single layer from `LAYER_LIST`. The output path specifies the directory in\n"
"      which the files will be written."
msgstr "将图层绘制到一个或多个 DXF 文件中，每个文件代表 `LAYER_LIST` 中的一个单独图层。输出路径指定了文件将被写入的目录。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:466 cli.adoc:587 cli.adoc:677 cli.adoc:953 cli.adoc:1439
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--plot-invisible-text`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:469 cli.adoc:590 cli.adoc:680 cli.adoc:956 cli.adoc:1442
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Force plotting of values and references, even if they are invisible. This argument is deprecated as of KiCad\n"
"      9.0.1 and has no effect. It will be removed in a future version of KiCad. To plot invisible text, edit the\n"
"      board so that the text is no longer invisible."
msgstr "强制绘制值和位号，即使它们不可见。此参数自 KiCad 9.0.1起已废弃且无效。它将在未来版本的 KiCad 中被移除。要绘制不可见文本，请编辑电路板以使文本不再不可见。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:470 cli.adoc:967 cli.adoc:1193 cli.adoc:1443
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--scale <scale>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:472 cli.adoc:969 cli.adoc:1445
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A scaling factor to use for plotting the PCB. The border and title block\n"
"      are not scaled. A scale factor of 0 autoscales the plot."
msgstr "用于绘制 PCB 的缩放比例。边框和标题栏不进行缩放。缩放比例为 0 时，绘图将自动调整比例。"

#. type: Title ===
#: cli.adoc:474
#, no-wrap
msgid "PCB GenCAD export"
msgstr "PCB GenCAD 导出"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:477
msgid "The `pcb export gencad` command exports a board design to a GenCAD file."
msgstr "`pcb export gencad` 命令将电路板设计导出为 GenCAD 文件。"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:479
msgid "Usage: `kicad-cli pcb export gencad [--help] [--output OUTPUT_FILE] [--define-var KEY=VALUE] [--flip-bottom-pads] [--unique-pins] [--unique-footprints] [--use-drill-origin] [--store-origin-coord] INPUT_FILE`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:497
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The output filename. When `--output` is not used, the output filename\n"
"      will be the same as the input file, with the `.cad` file extension."
msgstr "输出文件名。当未使用 `--output` 时，输出文件名将与输入文件相同，并带有 `.cad` 文件扩展名。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:501
#, no-wrap
msgid "`-f`, `--flip-bottom-pads`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:502
#, no-wrap
msgid "Flip bottom footprint padstacks."
msgstr "翻转底部封装 padstacks。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:503
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--unique-pins`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:504
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generate unique pin names."
msgstr "生成唯一的引脚名称。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:505
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--unique-footprints`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:506
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generate a new shape for each footprint instance (do not reuse shapes)."
msgstr "为每个封装实例生成一个新形状（不要重复使用形状）。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:507
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--use-drill-origin`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:508
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use drill/place file origin as origin."
msgstr "使用钻孔/放置文件的原点作为原点。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:509
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--store-origin-coord`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:510
#, no-wrap
msgid "Save the origin coordinates in the file."
msgstr "将原始坐标保存到文件中。"

#. type: Title ===
#: cli.adoc:512
#, no-wrap
msgid "PCB Gerber export: one layer per file"
msgstr "PCB Gerber 文件导出：每个文件包含多个层"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:516
msgid "The `pcb export gerbers` command exports a board design to Gerber files, with one layer per file."
msgstr "`pcb export gerbers` 命令将电路板设计导出为 Gerber 文件，每个文件对应一层。"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:522 cli.adoc:610
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Be aware that there are two distinct Gerber export commands, `gerber` and\n"
"      `gerbers`. The `gerber` command plots multiple PCB layers to a single\n"
"      Gerber file, while the `gerbers` command plots multiple Gerber files, with\n"
"      one PCB layer per file. The `gerbers` command is typically the correct\n"
"      command to use for having a PCB fabricated.\n"
msgstr "请注意，Gerber 导出命令有两个不同的版本，即 `gerber` 和 `gerbers`。`gerber` 命令将多个 PCB 层绘制到一个 Gerber 文件中，而 `gerbers` 命令则将多个 Gerber 文件绘制出来，每个文件对应一个 PCB 层。通常情况下，`gerbers` 命令是用于 PCB 制造的正确命令。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:524
msgid ""
"Usage: `kicad-cli pcb export gerbers [--help] [--output OUTPUT_DIR] [--layers LAYER_LIST] [--drawing-sheet SHEET_PATH] [--define-var KEY=VALUE] [--exclude-refdes] [--exclude-value] [--include-border-title] [--sketch-pads-on-fab-layers] [--hide-DNP-footprints-"
"on-fab-layers] [--sketch-DNP-footprints-on-fab-layers] [--crossout-DNP-footprints-on-fab-layers] [--no-x2] [--no-netlist] [--subtract-soldermask] [--disable-aperture-macros] [--use-drill-file-origin] [--precision PRECISION] [--no-protel-ext] [--plot-"
"invisible-text] [--common-layers COMMON_LAYER_LIST] [--board-plot-params] INPUT_FILE`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:539 cli.adoc:631
#, no-wrap
msgid "Show help for the Gerber export command."
msgstr "显示 Gerber 导出命令的帮助信息。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:543
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The output folder for the exported files. One file is output for each\n"
"      layer. When `--output` is not used, the files are exported to the\n"
"      current directory."
msgstr "导出文件的输出文件夹。当未使用 `--output` 时，文件将导出到当前目录。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:550
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A comma-separated list of layer names to plot from the board, such as\n"
"      `F.Cu,B.Cu`. If this argument is not used, all layers will be plotted.\n"
"      A seperate output file is plotted for each layer. Layer names can be\n"
"      specified as canonical layer names (`F.Cu`, `In.1`, `F.Fab`, etc.) or as\n"
"      user-defined (custom) layer names, but user-defined layer names are matched\n"
"      first."
msgstr "从电路板中绘制的图层名称的逗号分隔列表，例如 `F.Cu,B.Cu`。如果未使用此参数，则将绘制所有图层。每个图层都会生成一个单独的输出文件。图层名称可以指定为规范图层名称（如 `F.Cu`、`In.1`、`F.Fab` 等）或用户自定义（自定义）图层名称，但优先匹配用户自定义的图层名称。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:561 cli.adoc:651 cli.adoc:926 cli.adoc:1155
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--ibt`, `--include-border-title`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:562 cli.adoc:652 cli.adoc:927 cli.adoc:1156
#, no-wrap
msgid "Include the sheet border and title block."
msgstr "包含图纸边框和标题栏。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:571 cli.adoc:661
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--no-x2`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:572 cli.adoc:662
#, no-wrap
msgid "Do not use the extended X2 format."
msgstr "请勿使用扩展的 X2 格式。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:573 cli.adoc:663
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--no-netlist`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:574 cli.adoc:664
#, no-wrap
msgid "Do not include netlist attributes."
msgstr "请勿包含网表属性。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:577 cli.adoc:667
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--disable-aperture-macros`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:578 cli.adoc:668
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disable aperture macros."
msgstr "禁用光圈宏。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:579 cli.adoc:669 cli.adoc:1089
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--use-drill-file-origin`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:580 cli.adoc:670
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use drill/place file origin instead of absolute origin."
msgstr "使用钻孔/放置文件原点而非绝对原点。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:581 cli.adoc:671 cli.adoc:789 cli.adoc:872
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--precision <precision>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:583 cli.adoc:673
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The precision (number of digits) for the Gerber files. Valid options are\n"
"      `5` or `6` (default)."
msgstr "Gerber 文件的精度（位数）。有效选项为 `5` 或 `6`（默认值）。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:584 cli.adoc:674
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--no-protel-ext`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:586 cli.adoc:676
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use `.gbr` file extension instead of Protel file extensions (`.gbl`,\n"
"      `.gtl`, etc.)."
msgstr "使用 `.gbr` 文件扩展名，而非 Protel 文件扩展名（如 `.gbl`、`.gtl` 等）。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:596 cli.adoc:1142
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A comma-separated list of layer names to plot on all layers, such as\n"
"      `F.Cu,B.Cu`. Each layer specified is included in every output file. Layer\n"
"      names can be specified as canonical layer names (`F.Cu`, `In.1`, `F.Fab`,\n"
"      etc.) or as user-defined (custom) layer names, but user-defined layer names\n"
"      are matched first."
msgstr "在所有图层上绘制的图层名称的逗号分隔列表，例如 `F.Cu,B.Cu`。每个指定的图层都会包含在每个输出文件中。图层名称可以指定为规范图层名称（如 `F.Cu`、`In.1`、`F.Fab` 等）或用户自定义（自定义）图层名称，但会优先匹配用户自定义的图层名称。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:597
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--board-plot-params`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:598
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the Gerber plot settings already configured in the board file."
msgstr "使用电路板文件中已配置的 Gerber 绘制设置。"

#. type: Title ===
#: cli.adoc:600
#, no-wrap
msgid "PCB Gerber export: multiple layers per file"
msgstr "PCB Gerber 文件导出：每个文件包含多个层"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:604
msgid "The `pcb export gerber` command exports one or more board layers to a single Gerber file."
msgstr "`pcb export gerber` 命令将一个或多个电路板层导出到单个 Gerber 文件中。"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:614
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `pcb export gerber` command is deprecated in KiCad 9.0 and will be\n"
"         removed in KiCad 10.0. Please use the `pcb export gerbers` command\n"
"         instead.\n"
msgstr "`pcb export gerber` 命令在 KiCad 9.0 中已废弃，并在 KiCad 10.0 中将被移除。请改用 `pcb export gerbers` 命令。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:616
msgid ""
"Usage: `kicad-cli pcb export gerber [--help] [--output OUTPUT_FILE] [--layers LAYER_LIST] [--drawing-sheet SHEET_PATH] [--define-var KEY=VALUE] [--exclude-refdes] [--exclude-value] [--include-border-title] [--sketch-pads-on-fab-layers] [--hide-DNP-footprints-"
"on-fab-layers] [--sketch-DNP-footprints-on-fab-layers] [--crossout-DNP-footprints-on-fab-layers] [--no-x2] [--no-netlist] [--subtract-soldermask] [--disable-aperture-macros] [--use-drill-file-origin] [--precision PRECISION] [--no-protel-ext] [--plot-"
"invisible-text] INPUT_FILE`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:634
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The output filename. When `--output` is not used, the output filename\n"
"      will be the same as the input file, with the `.gbr` file extension."
msgstr "输出文件名。当未使用 `--output` 时，输出文件名将与输入文件相同，并带有 `.gbr` 文件扩展名。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:640
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A comma-separated list of layer names to plot from the board, such as\n"
"      `F.Cu,B.Cu`. All layers will be plotted in the output file. At least one\n"
"      layer must be given. Layer names can be specified as canonical layer names\n"
"      (`F.Cu`, `In.1`, `F.Fab`, etc.) or as user-defined (custom) layer names,\n"
"      but user-defined layer names are matched first."
msgstr "从电路板绘制的图层名称的逗号分隔列表，例如 `F.Cu,B.Cu`。所有图层都将在输出文件中绘制。必须至少指定一个图层。图层名称可以指定为规范图层名称（如 `F.Cu`、`In.1`、`F.Fab` 等），也可以指定为用户定义（自定义）的图层名称，但优先匹配用户定义的图层名称。"

#. type: Title ===
#: cli.adoc:682
#, no-wrap
msgid "PCB GLB export"
msgstr "PCB GLB 导出"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:686
msgid "The `pcb export glb` command exports a board design to a GLB (binary glTF) 3D model file."
msgstr "`pcb export glb` 命令将电路板设计导出为 GLB（二进制 glTF）3D 模型文件。"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:688
msgid ""
"Usage: `kicad-cli pcb export glb [--help] [--output OUTPUT_FILE] [--define-var KEY=VALUE] [--force] [--no-unspecified] [--no-dnp] [--grid-origin] [--drill-origin] [--subst-models] [--board-only] [--cut-vias-in-body] [--no-board-body] [--no-components] [--"
"component-filter VAR] [--include-tracks] [--include-pads] [--include-zones] [--include-inner-copper] [--include-silkscreen] [--include-soldermask] [--fuse-shapes] [--fill-all-vias] [--min-distance MIN_DIST] [--net-filter VAR] [--user-origin VAR] INPUT_FILE`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:703
#, no-wrap
msgid "Show help for the GLB export command."
msgstr "显示 GLB 导出命令的帮助信息。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:706
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The output filename. When `--output` is not used, the output filename\n"
"      will be the same as the input file, with the `.glb` file extension."
msgstr "输出文件名。当未使用 `--output` 时，输出文件名将与输入文件相同，并带有 `.glb` 文件扩展名。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:722
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Replace VRML models in footprints with STEP or IGS models of the same name, if\n"
"      they exist."
msgstr "如果存在同名的 STEP 或 IGS 模型，则用它们替换封装中的 VRML 模型。"

#. type: Title ===
#: cli.adoc:761
#, no-wrap
msgid "PCB IPC-2581 export"
msgstr "PCB IPC-2581 导出"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:764
msgid "The `pcb export ipc2581` command exports a board design in IPC-2581 format."
msgstr "`pcb export ipc2581` 命令将电路板设计导出为 IPC-2581 格式。"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:766
msgid ""
"Usage: `kicad-cli pcb export ipc2581 [--help] [--output OUTPUT_FILE] [--drawing-sheet SHEET_PATH] [--define-var KEY=VALUE] [--precision PRECISION] [--compress] [--version VAR] [--units VAR] [--bom-col-int-id FIELD_NAME] [--bom-col-mfg-pn FIELD_NAME] [--bom-"
"col-mfg FIELD_NAME] [--bom-col-dist-pn FIELD_NAME] [--bom-col-dist FIELD_NAME] INPUT_FILE`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:779
#, no-wrap
msgid "Show help for the IPC-2581 export command."
msgstr "显示 IPC-2581 导出命令的帮助信息。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:782
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The output filename. When `--output` is not used, the output filename\n"
"      will be the same as the input file, with the `.xml` file extension."
msgstr "输出文件名。当未使用 `--output` 时，输出文件名将与输入文件相同，并带有 `.xml` 文件扩展名。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:791
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The precision (number of digits after the decimal separator) for the\n"
"      exported file. The default is `6`."
msgstr "导出文件的精度（小数点后位数）。默认值为 `6`。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:792
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--compress`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:793
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compress output file as a ZIP file."
msgstr "将输出文件压缩为 ZIP 文件。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:794
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--version <IPC-2581 standard version>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:795
#, no-wrap
msgid "IPC-2581 standard version to use. Options are `B` or `C` (default)."
msgstr "使用 IPC-2581 标准版本。可选项为 `B` 或 `C`（默认）。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:796
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--units`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:797
#, no-wrap
msgid "Units to use in export. Options are `mm` (default) or `in`."
msgstr "用于导出的单位。可选单位为 `mm`（默认）或 `in`。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:798
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--bom-col-int-id`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:800
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Name of the part field to use for the Bill of Materials Internal ID\n"
"      column. This can be any footprint field, or blank to omit this column."
msgstr "用于 BOM 内部 ID 列的元件字段名称。可以是任何封装字段，或留空以省略该列。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:801
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--bom-col-mfg-pn`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:804
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Name of the part field to use for the Bill of Materials Manufacturer Part\n"
"      Number column. This can be any footprint field, or blank to omit this\n"
"      column."
msgstr "用于 BOM 制造商元件编号列的元件字段名称。可以是任何封装字段，或留空以省略该列。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:805
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--bom-col-mfg`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:807
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Name of the part field to use for the Bill of Materials Manufacturer\n"
"      column. This can be any footprint field, or blank to omit this column."
msgstr "用于 BOM 制造商列的元件字段名称。可以是任何封装字段，或留空以省略该列。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:808
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--bom-col-dist-pn`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:811
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Name of the part field to use for the Bill of Materials Distributor Part\n"
"      Number column. This can be any footprint field, or blank to omit this\n"
"      column."
msgstr "用于 BOM 分销商元件编号列的元件字段名称。可以是任何封装字段，或留空以省略该列。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:812
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--bom-col-dist`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:814
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Name of the part field to use for the Bill of Materials Distributor\n"
"      column. This can be any footprint field, or blank to omit this column."
msgstr "用于 BOM 分销商列的元件字段名称。可以是任何封装字段，或留空以省略该列。"

#. type: Title ===
#: cli.adoc:816
#, no-wrap
msgid "PCB IPC-D-356 export"
msgstr "PCB IPC-D-356 导出"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:819
msgid "The `pcb export ipcd356` command generates an IPC-D-356 netlist from the board design."
msgstr "`pcb export ipcd356` 命令从电路板设计中生成 IPC-D-356 网表。"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:821
msgid "Usage: `kicad-cli pcb export ipcd356 [--help] [--output OUTPUT_FILE] INPUT_FILE`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:836
#, no-wrap
msgid "Show help for the IPC-D-356 export command."
msgstr "显示 IPC-D-356 导出命令的帮助信息。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:839
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The output filename. When `--output` is not used, the output filename\n"
"      will be the same as the input file, with the `.d356` file extension."
msgstr "输出文件名。当未使用 `--output` 时，输出文件名将与输入文件相同，并带有 `.d356` 文件扩展名。"

#. type: Title ===
#: cli.adoc:841
#, no-wrap
msgid "PCB ODB++ export"
msgstr "PCB ODB++ 导出"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:844
msgid "The `pcb export odb` command exports a board design in ODB++ format."
msgstr "`pcb export odb` 命令将电路板设计导出为 ODB++ 格式。"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:846
msgid "Usage: `kicad-cli pcb export odb [--help] [--output OUTPUT_FILE] [--drawing-sheet SHEET_PATH] [--define-var KEY=VALUE] [--precision PRECISION] [--compression VAR] [--units VAR] INPUT_FILE`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:863
#, no-wrap
msgid "Show help for the ODB++ export command."
msgstr "显示 ODB++ 导出命令的帮助信息。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:865
#, no-wrap
msgid "The output filename, or folder name if no compression is used."
msgstr "输出文件名，或在不使用压缩时为文件夹名。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:874
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The precision (number of digits after the decimal separator) for the\n"
"      exported file. The default is `2`."
msgstr "导出文件的精度（小数点后位数）。默认值为 `2`。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:875
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--compression <mode>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:876
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compression mode. Options are `none`, `zip` (default), or `tgz`."
msgstr "压缩模式。可选项为 `none`、`zip`（默认）或 `tgz`。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:878
#, no-wrap
msgid "Units to use in the output file. Options are `mm` (default) or `in`."
msgstr "输出文件中使用的单位。可选单位为 `mm`（默认）或 `in`。"

#. type: Title ===
#: cli.adoc:880
#, no-wrap
msgid "PCB PDF export"
msgstr "PCB PDF 导出"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:883
msgid "The `pcb export pdf` command exports a board design to a PDF file. Each layer can be plotted as its own file or as a sheet within a single file."
msgstr "`pcb export pdf` 命令将电路板设计导出为 PDF 文件。每个层可以单独导出为独立的文件，也可以作为单个文件中的一个页面进行导出。"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:885
msgid ""
"Usage: `kicad-cli pcb export pdf [--help] [--output OUTPUT_DIR] [--layers LAYER_LIST] [--drawing-sheet SHEET_PATH] [--define-var KEY=VALUE] [--mirror] [--exclude-refdes] [--exclude-value] [--include-border-title] [--subtract-soldermask] [--sketch-pads-on-fab-"
"layers] [--hide-DNP-footprints-on-fab-layers] [--sketch-DNP-footprints-on-fab-layers] [--crossout-DNP-footprints-on-fab-layers] [--negative] [--black-and-white] [--theme THEME_NAME] [--drill-shape-opt VAR] [--common-layers COMMON_LAYER_LIST] [--plot-"
"invisible-text] [--mode-single] [--mode-separate] [--mode-multipage] [--scale SCALE] [--bg-color COLOR] INPUT_FILE`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:900
#, no-wrap
msgid "Show help for the PDF export command."
msgstr "显示 PDF 导出命令的帮助信息。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:907
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The output folder or filename for the exported files. When `--mode-single`\n"
"      or `--mode-multipage` is used, this is the output filename. If this\n"
"      argument is not used, the output filename will be the same as the input\n"
"      file, with the `.pdf` file extension. When `--mode-separate` is used, this is\n"
"      the output directory. If `--output` is not used, the files are exported\n"
"      to the current directory."
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:913 cli.adoc:1136
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A comma-separated list of layer names to export from the board, such as\n"
"      `F.Cu,B.Cu`. At least one layer must be given. Layer names can be\n"
"      specified as canonical layer names (`F.Cu`, `In.1`, `F.Fab`, etc.) or as \n"
"      user-defined (custom) layer names, but user-defined layer names are matched\n"
"      first."
msgstr "从电路板中导出的图层名称列表，以逗号分隔，例如 `F.Cu,B.Cu`。必须至少指定一个图层。图层名称可以指定为规范图层名称（如 `F.Cu`、`In.1`、`F.Fab` 等）或用户自定义（自定义）图层名称，但优先匹配用户自定义图层名称。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:920 cli.adoc:1149 cli.adoc:1399
#, no-wrap
msgid "`-m`, `--mirror`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:921 cli.adoc:1150 cli.adoc:1400
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mirror the board. This can be useful for showing bottom layers."
msgstr "镜像电路板。这对于显示底层电路非常有用。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:938 cli.adoc:1167 cli.adoc:1404
#, no-wrap
msgid "`-n`, `--negative`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:939 cli.adoc:1168 cli.adoc:1405
#, no-wrap
msgid "Plot in negative."
msgstr "在负片上绘制。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:941 cli.adoc:1170 cli.adoc:1407
#, no-wrap
msgid "Plot in black and white."
msgstr "黑白绘制。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:944 cli.adoc:1173 cli.adoc:1403
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The name of the theme to use for export. If no theme is given, the\n"
"      board editor's currently selected theme is used."
msgstr "用于导出的主题名称。如果未指定主题，则使用板编辑器当前选定的主题。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:945 cli.adoc:1174 cli.adoc:1425
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--drill-shape-opt`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:958
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generates a single file with the output arg path acting as the complete directory and filename path. `COMMON_LAYER_LIST` does not function in this mode. Instead `LAYER_LIST` controls all layers plotted. All specified layers are plotted on a single page."
msgstr "生成一个单一文件，输出参数路径作为完整的目录和文件名路径。在此模式下，`COMMON_LAYER_LIST` 不起作用，而是由 `LAYER_LIST` 控制所有绘制的图层。所有指定的图层将绘制在同一页面上。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:959
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--mode-separate`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:962 cli.adoc:1182
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Plot the layers to one or more PDF files, with each file representing a\n"
"      single layer from `LAYER_LIST`. The output path specifies the directory in\n"
"      which the files will be written."
msgstr "将图层绘制为一个或多个 PDF 文件，每个文件代表 `LAYER_LIST` 中的一个单独图层。输出路径指定了文件将被写入的目录。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:963 cli.adoc:1179
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--mode-multipage`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:966
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Plot the layers to a single PDF file with multiple pages, with each page\n"
"      representing a single layer from `LAYER_LIST`. The output path specifies\n"
"      the complete directory and filename path."
msgstr "将图层绘制到一个包含多页的 PDF 文件中，每页代表 `LAYER_LIST` 中的一个单独图层。输出路径指定完整的目录和文件名路径。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:970
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--bg-color <color>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:972
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A background color for the plot. The format can be hex (`#rrggbb` or\n"
"      `#rrggbbaa`) or CSS (`rgb(r,g,b)` or `rgba(r,g,b,a)`)."
msgstr "为图表设置背景颜色。格式可以是十六进制（`#rrggbb` 或 `#rrggbbaa`）或 CSS（`rgb(r,g,b)` 或 `rgba(r,g,b,a)`）。"

#. type: Title ===
#: cli.adoc:974
#, no-wrap
msgid "PCB PLY file export"
msgstr "PCB PLY 文件导出"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:977
msgid "The `pcb export ply` command exports a board design to a PLY 3D model file."
msgstr "`pcb export ply` 命令将电路板设计导出为 PLY 3D 模型文件。"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:979
msgid ""
"Usage: `kicad-cli pcb export ply [--help] [--output OUTPUT_FILE] [--define-var KEY=VALUE] [--force] [--no-unspecified] [--no-dnp] [--grid-origin] [--drill-origin] [--subst-models] [--board-only] [--cut-vias-in-body] [--no-board-body] [--no-components] [--"
"component-filter VAR] [--include-tracks] [--include-pads] [--include-zones] [--include-inner-copper] [--include-silkscreen] [--include-soldermask] [--fuse-shapes] [--fill-all-vias] [--min-distance MIN_DIST] [--net-filter VAR] [--user-origin VAR] INPUT_FILE`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:994
#, no-wrap
msgid "Show help for the PLY export command."
msgstr "显示 PLY 导出命令的帮助信息。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:997
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The output filename. When `--output` is not used, the output filename\n"
"      will be the same as the input file, with the `.ply` file extension."
msgstr "输出文件名。当未使用 `--output` 时，输出文件名将与输入文件相同，并带有 `.ply` 文件扩展名。"

#. type: Title ===
#: cli.adoc:1052
#, no-wrap
msgid "PCB position file export"
msgstr "PCB 位置文件导出"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:1055
msgid "The `pcb export pos` command exports a position file from a board design."
msgstr "`pcb export pos` 命令从电路板设计中导出位置文件。"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:1057
msgid "Usage: `kicad-cli pcb export pos [--help] [--output OUTPUT_FILE] [--side VAR] [--format FORMAT] [--units UNITS] [--bottom-negate-x] [--use-drill-file-origin] [--smd-only] [--exclude-fp-th] [--exclude-dnp] [--gerber-board-edge] INPUT_FILE`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1073
#, no-wrap
msgid "Show help for the position file export command."
msgstr "显示位置文件导出命令的帮助信息。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1076
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The output filename. When `--output` is not used, the output filename\n"
"      will be the same as the input file, with the `.pos` file extension."
msgstr "输出文件名。当未使用 `--output` 时，输出文件名将与输入文件相同，并带有 `.pos` 文件扩展名。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1077 cli.adoc:1605
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--side <side>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1079
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The side of the board to export. Options are `front`, `back`, or `both`\n"
"      (default). Gerber format does not support `both`."
msgstr "要导出的电路板侧面。可选项为 `front`（正面）、`back`（背面）或 `both`（两面）（默认）。Gerber 格式不支持 `both`。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1082
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The position file format. Options are `ascii` (default), `csv`, or\n"
"      `gerber`."
msgstr "位置文件格式。可选格式包括 `ascii`（默认）、`csv` 或 `gerber`。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1085
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Units for position file. Options are `in` (default) or `mm`. This option\n"
"      has no effect for Gerber format."
msgstr "位置文件的单位。可选值为 `in`（默认）或 `mm`。此选项对 Gerber 格式无效。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1086
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--bottom-negate-x`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1088
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use negative X coordinates for footprints on the bottom layer. This\n"
"      option has no effect for Gerber format."
msgstr "在底层的封装中使用负 X 坐标。此选项对 Gerber 格式无效。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1091
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use drill/place file origin instead of absolute origin. This option has no\n"
"      effect for Gerber format."
msgstr "使用钻孔/放置文件原点而非绝对原点。此选项对 Gerber 格式无效。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1092
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--smd-only`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1094
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Include only surface-mount components. This option has no effect for\n"
"      Gerber format."
msgstr "仅包含表面贴装元件。此选项对 Gerber 格式无效。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1095
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--exclude-fp-th`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1097
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Exclude all footprints with through-hole pads. This option has no effect\n"
"      for Gerber format."
msgstr "排除所有带有通孔焊盘的焊盘。此选项对 Gerber 格式无效。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1098 cli.adoc:1750
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--exclude-dnp`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1099
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exclude all footprints with \"Do not populate\" attribute."
msgstr "排除所有具有 “DNP” 属性的封装。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1100
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--gerber-board-edge`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1101
#, no-wrap
msgid "Include board edge layer in export (Gerber format only)."
msgstr "在导出时包含电路板边缘层（仅限 Gerber 格式）。"

#. type: Title ===
#: cli.adoc:1103
#, no-wrap
msgid "PCB PostScript export"
msgstr "PCB PostScript 导出"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:1106
msgid "The `pcb export ps` command exports a board design to a PostScript file."
msgstr "`pcb export ps` 命令将电路板设计导出为 PostScript 文件。"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:1108
msgid ""
"Usage: `kicad-cli pcb export ps [--help] [--output OUTPUT_DIR] [--layers LAYER_LIST] [--common-layers COMMON_LAYER_LIST] [--drawing-sheet SHEET_PATH] [--define-var KEY=VALUE]... [--mirror] [--exclude-refdes] [--exclude-value] [--include-border-title] [--"
"subtract-soldermask] [--sketch-pads-on-fab-layers] [--hide-DNP-footprints-on-fab-layers] [--sketch-DNP-footprints-on-fab-layers] [--crossout-DNP-footprints-on-fab-layers] [--negative] [--black-and-white] [--theme THEME_NAME] [--drill-shape-opt VAR] [--mode-"
"single] [--mode-multi] [--track-width-correction TRACK_COR] [--x-scale-factor X_SCALE] [--y-scale-factor Y_SCALE] [--force-a4] [--scale SCALE] INPUT_FILE`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1123
#, no-wrap
msgid "Show help for the PS export command."
msgstr "显示 PS 导出命令的帮助信息。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1183
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--C`, `--track-width-correction`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1186
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A global correction, in millimeters, that is added to the size of tracks,\n"
"      vias, and pads when plotted. This correction can be used to correct for\n"
"      errors in the PostScript output device to achieve an exact-scale output."
msgstr "全局校正，以毫米为单位，在绘制时添加到走线、过孔和焊盘的尺寸上。此校正可用于修正 PostScript 输出设备的误差，以实现精确比例的输出。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1187
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--X`, `--x-scale-factor`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1188
#, no-wrap
msgid "X scale adjust for exact scale."
msgstr "X 轴比例调整以实现精确比例。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1189
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--Y`, `--y-scale-factor`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1190
#, no-wrap
msgid "Y scale adjust for exact scale."
msgstr "Y 轴比例调整以实现精确比例。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1191
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--A`, `--force-a4`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1192
#, no-wrap
msgid "Force A4 paper size."
msgstr "强制使用 A4 纸张尺寸。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1195
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A scaling factor to use for plotting the pcb. The border and title block\n"
"      are not scaled. A scale factor of 0 autoscales the plot."
msgstr "用于绘制 PCB 的缩放比例因子。边框和标题栏不进行缩放。缩放因子为 0 时，自动调整绘图比例。"

#. type: Title ===
#: cli.adoc:1197
#, no-wrap
msgid "PCB STEP export"
msgstr "PCB STEP 导出"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:1200
msgid "The `pcb export step` command exports a board design to a STEP file."
msgstr "`pcb export step` 命令将电路板设计导出为 STEP 文件。"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:1202
msgid ""
"Usage: `kicad-cli pcb export step [--help] [--output OUTPUT_FILE] [--define-var KEY=VALUE] [--force] [--no-unspecified] [--no-dnp] [--grid-origin] [--drill-origin] [--subst-models] [--board-only] [--cut-vias-in-body] [--no-board-body] [--no-components] [--"
"component-filter VAR] [--include-tracks] [--include-pads] [--include-zones] [--include-inner-copper] [--include-silkscreen] [--include-soldermask] [--fuse-shapes] [--fill-all-vias] [--min-distance MIN_DIST] [--net-filter VAR] [--no-optimize-step] [--user-"
"origin VAR] INPUT_FILE`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1217
#, no-wrap
msgid "Show help for the STEP file export command."
msgstr "`pcb export gerbers` 命令将电路板设计导出为 Gerber 文件，每个文件对应一层。显示 STEP 文件导出命令的帮助信息。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1220
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The output filename. When `--output` is not used, the output filename\n"
"      will be the same as the input file, with the `.step` file extension."
msgstr "输出文件名。当未使用 `--output` 时，输出文件名将与输入文件相同，并带有`.step`文件扩展名。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1270
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--no-optimize-step`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1273
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Do not optimize STEP file. This enables writing parametric curves, which\n"
"      reduces file sizes and write/read times, but may reduce compatibility with\n"
"      other software."
msgstr "请勿优化 STEP 文件。此操作可实现参数化曲线的写入，从而减少文件大小并缩短写入/读取时间，但可能降低与其他软件的兼容性。"

#. type: Title ===
#: cli.adoc:1279
#, no-wrap
msgid "PCB STL export"
msgstr "PCB STL 导出"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:1282
msgid "The `pcb export stl` command exports a board design to an STL 3D model file."
msgstr "`pcb export stl` 命令将电路板设计导出为 STL 3D 模型文件。"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:1284
msgid ""
"Usage: `kicad-cli pcb export stl [--help] [--output OUTPUT_FILE] [--define-var KEY=VALUE] [--force] [--no-unspecified] [--no-dnp] [--grid-origin] [--drill-origin] [--subst-models] [--board-only] [--cut-vias-in-body] [--no-board-body] [--no-components] [--"
"component-filter VAR] [--include-tracks] [--include-pads] [--include-zones] [--include-inner-copper] [--include-silkscreen] [--include-soldermask] [--fuse-shapes] [--fill-all-vias] [--min-distance MIN_DIST] [--net-filter VAR] [--user-origin VAR] INPUT_FILE`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1299
#, no-wrap
msgid "Show help for the STL export command."
msgstr "显示 STL 导出命令的帮助信息。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1302
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The output filename. When `--output` is not used, the output filename\n"
"      will be the same as the input file, with the `.stl` file extension."
msgstr "输出文件名。当未使用 `--output` 时，输出文件名将与输入文件相同，并带有 `.stl` 文件扩展名。"

#. type: Title ===
#: cli.adoc:1357
#, no-wrap
msgid "PCB SVG export"
msgstr "PCB SVG 导出"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:1360
msgid "The `pcb export svg` command exports a board design to an SVG file."
msgstr "`pcb export svg` 命令将电路板设计导出为 SVG 文件。"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:1362
msgid ""
"Usage: `kicad-cli pcb export svg [--help] [--output OUTPUT_DIR] [--layers LAYER_LIST] [--drawing-sheet SHEET_PATH] [--define-var KEY=VALUE] [--subtract-soldermask] [--mirror] [--theme THEME_NAME] [--negative] [--black-and-white] [--sketch-pads-on-fab-layers] "
"[--hide-DNP-footprints-on-fab-layers] [--sketch-DNP-footprints-on-fab-layers] [--crossout-DNP-footprints-on-fab-layers] [--page-size-mode MODE] [--fit-page-to-board] [--exclude-drawing-sheet] [--drill-shape-opt SHAPE_OPTION] [--common-layers "
"COMMON_LAYER_LIST] [--mode-single] [--mode-multi] [--plot-invisible-text] [--scale SCALE] INPUT_FILE`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1377 cli.adoc:1996
#, no-wrap
msgid "Show help for the SVG file export command."
msgstr "显示 SVG 文件导出命令的帮助信息。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1390
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A comma-separated list of layer names to export from the board, such as\n"
"      `F.Cu,B.Cu`. At least one layer must be given. Layer names can be\n"
"      specified as canonical layer names (`F.Cu`, `In.1`, `F.Fab`, etc.) or as\n"
"      user-defined (custom) layer names, but user-defined layer names are matched\n"
"      first."
msgstr "从电路板导出的图层名称列表，以逗号分隔，例如 `F.Cu,B.Cu`。必须至少指定一个图层。图层名称可以指定为规范图层名称（如 `F.Cu`、`In.1`、`F.Fab` 等）或用户自定义（自定义）图层名称，但优先匹配用户自定义的图层名称。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1416
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--page-size-mode <mode>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1420
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set page sizing mode. Options are `0` (default), `1`, or `2`. `0` sets the\n"
"      output page size to fit the entire sheet, including drawing sheet frame\n"
"      and title block. `1` sets the output page size to match the current page\n"
"      size. `2` sets the output page size to the size of the board itself."
msgstr "设置页面尺寸模式。选项为 `0`（默认）、`1` 或 `2`。`0` 将输出页面尺寸设置为适合整个图纸，包括图框和标题框。`1` 将输出页面尺寸设置为与当前页面尺寸相匹配。`2` 将输出页面尺寸设置为图纸本身的尺寸。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1421
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--fit-page-to-board`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1422
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set the SVG size to match the board outline. This is equivalent to `--page-size-mode 2`."
msgstr "将 SVG 大小设置为与电路板外框匹配。这相当于 `--page-size-mode 2`。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1423
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--exclude-drawing-sheet`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1424 cli.adoc:2012
#, no-wrap
msgid "Plot SVG without a drawing sheet."
msgstr "在没有图框的情况下绘制 SVG。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1438
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Plot the layers to one or more SVG files, with each file representing a\n"
"      single layer from `LAYER_LIST`. The output path specifies the directory in\n"
"      which the files will be written."
msgstr "将图层绘制到一个或多个 SVG 文件中，每个文件代表 `LAYER_LIST` 中的一个单独图层。输出路径指定了文件将被写入的目录。"

#. type: Title ===
#: cli.adoc:1447
#, no-wrap
msgid "PCB VRML export"
msgstr "PCB VRML 导出"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:1450
msgid "The `pcb export vrml` command exports a board design to a VRML 3D model file."
msgstr "`pcb export vrml` 命令将电路板设计导出为 VRML 3D 文件。"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:1452
msgid "Usage: `kicad-cli pcb export vrml [--help] [--output OUTPUT_FILE] [--define-var KEY=VALUE] [--force] [--no-unspecified] [--no-dnp] [--user-origin VAR] [--units VAR] [--models-dir VAR] [--models-relative] INPUT_FILE`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1467
#, no-wrap
msgid "Show help for the VRML export command."
msgstr "显示 VRML 导出命令的帮助信息。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1470
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The output filename. When `--output` is not used, the output filename\n"
"      will be the same as the input file, with the `.wrl` file extension."
msgstr "输出文件名。当未使用 `--output` 时，输出文件名将与输入文件相同，并带有 `.wrl` 文件扩展名。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1483
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Specify a custom origin for the output file, with X and Y coordinates. For\n"
"      example, `1x1in`, `1x1inch`, or `25.4x25.4mm`. The default unit is\n"
"      millimeters. If this option is not given, the board center is used."
msgstr "指定输出文件的自定义原点，包括 X 和 Y 坐标。例如，`1x1in`、`1x1inch` 或 `25.4x25.4mm`。默认单位为毫米。如果未指定此选项，则使用电路板中心作为原点。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1484
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--units <units>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1486
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Units to use in the output file. Options are `mm`, `m`, `in` (default), or\n"
"      `tenths` (tenths of an inch)."
msgstr "输出文件中使用的单位。可选单位包括 `mm`、`m`、`in`（默认）或 `tenths`（英寸的十分之一）。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1487
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--models-dir <output model directory>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1489
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Name of output directory to copy component models into. If not used,\n"
"      component models are embedded into the output file."
msgstr "输出目录的名称，用于复制组件模型。如果未指定，组件模型将嵌入到输出文件中。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1490
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--models-relative`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1491
#, no-wrap
msgid "With `--models-dir`, use relative paths in the output file."
msgstr "使用 `--models-dir` 时，输出文件中使用相对路径。"

#. type: Title ===
#: cli.adoc:1493
#, no-wrap
msgid "PCB XAO export"
msgstr "PCB XAO 导出"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:1497
msgid "The `pcb export xao` command exports a board design to an XAO (SALOME/Gmsh) 3D model file."
msgstr "`pcb export xao` 命令将电路板设计导出为 XAO（SALOME/Gmsh）3D 模型文件。"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:1499
msgid ""
"Usage: `kicad-cli pcb export xao [--help] [--output OUTPUT_FILE] [--define-var KEY=VALUE] [--force] [--no-unspecified] [--no-dnp] [--grid-origin] [--drill-origin] [--subst-models] [--board-only] [--cut-vias-in-body] [--no-board-body] [--no-components] [--"
"component-filter VAR] [--include-tracks] [--include-pads] [--include-zones] [--include-inner-copper] [--include-silkscreen] [--include-soldermask] [--fuse-shapes] [--fill-all-vias] [--min-distance MIN_DIST] [--net-filter VAR] [--user-origin VAR] INPUT_FILE`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1514
#, no-wrap
msgid "Show help for the XAO export command."
msgstr "显示 XAO 导出命令的帮助信息。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1517
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The output filename. When `--output` is not used, the output filename\n"
"      will be the same as the input file, with the `.xao` file extension."
msgstr "输出文件名。当未使用 `--output` 时，输出文件名将与输入文件相同，并带有 `.xao` 文件扩展名。"

#. type: Title ===
#: cli.adoc:1572
#, no-wrap
msgid "PCB render"
msgstr "PCB 渲染"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:1575
msgid "The `pcb render` command generates a raytraced rendering of the 3D model of the board and saves it to a PNG or JPEG file."
msgstr "`pcb render` 命令会生成电路板 3D 模型的光线追踪渲染图，并将其保存为 PNG 或 JPEG 文件。"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:1577
msgid ""
"Usage: `kicad-cli pcb render [--help] [--output OUTPUT_FILE] [--define-var KEY=VALUE] [--width WIDTH] [--height HEIGHT] [--side SIDE] [--background BG] [--quality QUALITY] [--preset PRESET] [--floor] [--perspective] [--zoom ZOOM] [--pan VECTOR] [--pivot "
"PIVOT] [--rotate ANGLES] [--light-top COLOR] [--light-bottom COLOR] [--light-side COLOR] [--light-camera COLOR] [--light-side-elevation ANGLE] INPUT_FILE`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1584
#, no-wrap
msgid "Board file to render."
msgstr "渲染电路板文件。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1592
#, no-wrap
msgid "Show help for the render command."
msgstr "显示渲染命令的帮助信息。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1597
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The output filename. This argument must be given. The file extension given\n"
"      in this argument determines the output image file format. The filename\n"
"      must end with either `.png` (for PNG files) or `.jpg`/`.jpeg` (for JPG\n"
"      files)."
msgstr "输出文件名。此参数必须指定。此参数中指定的文件扩展名决定了输出图像文件的格式。文件名必须以 `.png`（用于 PNG 文件）或 `.jpg`/`.jpeg`（用于 JPG 文件）结尾。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1601
#, no-wrap
msgid "`-w <width>`, `--width <width>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1602
#, no-wrap
msgid "Image width in pixels. Default: `1600`."
msgstr "图像宽度（以像素为单位）。默认值：`1600`。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1603
#, no-wrap
msgid "`-h <height>`, `--height <height>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1604
#, no-wrap
msgid "Image height in pixels. Default: `900`."
msgstr "图像高度（以像素为单位）。默认值：`900`。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1606
#, no-wrap
msgid "The side of the board to render. Options are `top` (default), `bottom`, `left`, `right`, `front`, or `back`."
msgstr "要渲染的板面。可选项包括 `top`（默认）、`bottom`、`left`、`right`、`front` 或 `back`。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1607
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--background <background>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1610
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Image background. Options are `default` (default), `transparent`, or\n"
"      `opaque`. For PNG files, `default` is `transparent`. For JPG files,\n"
"      `default` is `opaque`."
msgstr "图像背景。可选项为 `default`（默认）、`transparent` 或 `opaque`。对于 PNG 文件，`default` 默认为 `transparent`。对于 JPG 文件， `default` 默认为 `opaque`。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1611
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--quality <quality>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1613
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Render quality. Options are `basic` (default), `high`, `user`. When `user`\n"
"      is specified, the render settings stored in the project are used."
msgstr "渲染质量。可选项包括 `base`（默认）、`high` 和 `user`。当指定 `user` 时，将使用项目中存储的渲染设置。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1614
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--preset <color preset>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1616
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Color preset. Options are `follow_pcb_editor`, `follow_plot_settings`\n"
"      (default), or `legacy_preset_flag`."
msgstr "颜色预设。可选项包括 `follow_pcb_editor`、`follow_plot_settings`（默认）或 `legacy_preset_flag`。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1617
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--floor`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1618
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enables floor, shadows and post-processing, even if disabled in quality preset."
msgstr "启用地面、阴影和后期处理效果，即使在质量预设中已禁用。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1619
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--perspective`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1620
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use perspective projection instead of orthogonal."
msgstr "使用透视投影而非正交投影。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1621
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--zoom <zoom level>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1622
#, no-wrap
msgid "Camera zoom factor as an integer. Default: `1`."
msgstr "相机变焦倍数，以整数形式表示。默认值：`1`。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1623
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--pan <camera pan>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1624
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set camera pan location, in millimeters, with the format `'X,Y,Z'`, e.g. `'3,0,0'`."
msgstr "设置摄像头平移位置，单位为毫米，格式为 `'X,Y,Z'`，例如 `'3,0,0'`。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1625
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--pivot <pivot>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1627
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set pivot point relative to the board center in centimeters, with the\n"
"      format `'X,Y,Z'` e.g. `'-10,2,0'`."
msgstr "将枢轴点相对于板中心的位置以厘米为单位设置，格式为`'X,Y,Z'`，例如`'-10,2,0'`。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1628
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--rotate <rotation>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1630
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set board rotation around pivot point, in degrees, with the format\n"
"      `'X,Y,Z'`, e.g. `'-45,0,45'` for isometric view."
msgstr "设置板面绕枢轴点的旋转角度，单位为度，格式为 `'X,Y,Z'`，例如 `'-45,0,45'` 用于等轴测视图。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1631
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--light-top <intensity>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1632
#, no-wrap
msgid "Top light intensity, format `'R,G,B'` or a single number, range: 0-1."
msgstr "顶部光强度，格式为 `'R,G,B'` 或单个数字，范围：0-1。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1633
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--light-bottom <intensity>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1634
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bottom light intensity, format `'R,G,B'` or a single number, range: 0-1."
msgstr "底部光强度，格式为 `'R,G,B'` 或单个数字，范围：0-1。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1635
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--light-side <intensity>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1636
#, no-wrap
msgid "Side lights intensity, format `'R,G,B'` or a single number, range: 0-1."
msgstr "侧灯亮度，格式为 `'R,G,B'` 或单个数字，范围：0-1。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1637
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--light-camera <intensity>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1638
#, no-wrap
msgid "Camera light intensity, format `'R,G,B'` or a single number, range: 0-1."
msgstr "相机光线强度，格式为 `'R,G,B'` 或单个数字，范围：0-1。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1639
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--light-side-elevation <elevation>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1640
#, no-wrap
msgid "Side lights elevation angle in degrees, range: 0-90."
msgstr "侧灯仰角（单位：度），范围：0-90。"

#. type: Title ==
#: cli.adoc:1642
#, no-wrap
msgid "Schematic commands"
msgstr "原理图命令"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:1647
msgid "The `sch` command runs an electrical rule check, exports a schematic to various other file formats, or exports a bill of materials or netlist. Each subcommand has its own options."
msgstr "`sch` 命令可运行电气规则检查、将原理图导出为各种其他文件格式，或导出 BOM 或网表。每个子命令都有自己的选项。"

#. type: Title ===
#: cli.adoc:1648
#, no-wrap
msgid "Schematic ERC"
msgstr "原理图 ERC"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:1652
msgid "The `sch erc` command runs an electrical rule check on a schematic and generates a report."
msgstr "`sch erc` 命令对原理图进行电气规则检查并生成报告。"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:1654
msgid "Usage: `kicad-cli sch erc [--help] [--output OUTPUT_FILE] [--define-var KEY=VALUE] [--format VAR] [--units VAR] [--severity-all] [--severity-error] [--severity-warning] [--severity-exclusions] [--exit-code-violations] INPUT_FILE`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1661
#, no-wrap
msgid "Schematic file to run ERC on."
msgstr "运行 ERC 的原理图文件。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1669
#, no-wrap
msgid "Show help for the ERC command."
msgstr "显示 ERC 命令的帮助信息。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1673
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Output filename for the generated ERC report. When `--output` is not\n"
"      used, the output filename will be the same as the input file, with the\n"
"      `.rpt` or `.json` file extension, depending on the selected format."
msgstr "生成的 ERC 报告的输出文件名。当未使用 `--output` 时，输出文件名将与输入文件相同，文件扩展名根据所选格式不同，分别为 `.rpt` 或 `.json`。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1683
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Report all ERC violations. This is equivalent to using all of the other\n"
"      ERC severity options."
msgstr "报告所有 ERC 违规行为。这相当于使用所有其他 ERC 严重性选项。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1686
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Report all error-level ERC violations. This can be combined with the other\n"
"      ERC severity options."
msgstr "报告所有错误级别的 ERC 违规行为。这可以与其他 ERC 严重性选项结合使用。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1689
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Report all warning-level ERC violations. This can be combined with the\n"
"      other ERC severity options."
msgstr "报告所有警告级别的 ERC 违规行为。这可以与其他 ERC 严重性选项结合使用。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1692
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Report all excluded ERC violations. This can be combined with the other\n"
"      ERC severity options."
msgstr "报告所有被排除的 ERC 违规行为。这可以与其他 ERC 严重性选项结合使用。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1696
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Return an exit code depending on whether or not ERC violations exist. The\n"
"      exit code is 0 if no violations are found, and 5 if any violations are\n"
"      found."
msgstr "根据是否存在 ERC 违规情况返回退出代码。如果未发现违规，退出代码为 0；如果发现任何违规，退出代码为 5。"

#. type: Title ===
#: cli.adoc:1698
#, no-wrap
msgid "Schematic bill of materials export"
msgstr "原理图 BOM 导出"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:1705
msgid ""
"The `sch export bom` command exports a BOM from a schematic.  The BOM export has a number of options for controlling the format and included fields. This export method is equivalent to xref:../eeschema/eeschema.adoc#bom-export[exporting a BOM] from the "
"symbol fields table."
msgstr "`sch export bom` 命令从原理图导出 BOM。BOM 导出有多个选项可用于控制格式和包含的字段。此导出方法相当于从符号字段表导出 BOM (xref:../eeschema/eeschema.adoc#bom-export[导出 BOM])。"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:1708
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To export a BOM using the legacy XML and Python BOM script workflow, use\n"
"      the `sch export python-bom` command.\n"
msgstr "要使用旧版 XML 和 Python BOM 脚本工作流导出 BOM，请使用 `sch export python-bom` 命令。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:1710
msgid ""
"Usage: `kicad-cli sch export bom [--help] [--output OUTPUT_FILE] [--preset PRESET] [--format-preset FMT_PRESET] [--fields FIELDS] [--labels LABELS] [--group-by GROUP_BY] [--sort-field SORT_BY] [--sort-asc] [--filter FILTER] [--exclude-dnp] [--include-"
"excluded-from-bom] [--field-delimiter FIELD_DELIM] [--string-delimiter STR_DELIM] [--ref-delimiter REF_DELIM] [--ref-range-delimiter REF_RANGE_DELIM] [--keep-tabs] [--keep-line-breaks] INPUT_FILE`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1717 cli.adoc:1781 cli.adoc:1828 cli.adoc:1857 cli.adoc:1910 cli.adoc:1961 cli.adoc:1988
#, no-wrap
msgid "Schematic file to export."
msgstr "导出原理图文件。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1725
#, no-wrap
msgid "Shows help message and exits"
msgstr "显示帮助信息并退出"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1728
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The output filename. When `--output` is not used, the output filename\n"
"      will be the same as the input file, with a `.csv` file extension."
msgstr "输出文件名。当未使用 `--output` 时，输出文件名将与输入文件相同，并带有 `.csv` 文件扩展名。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1729
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--preset <preset>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1730
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use a named BOM preset setting from the schematic, e.g. `\"Grouped By Value\"`."
msgstr "使用原理图中的命名 BOM 预设设置，例如 `按值分组`。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1731
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--format-preset <format preset>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1732
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use a named BOM format preset setting from the schematic, e.g. `CSV`."
msgstr "使用原理图中的命名 BOM 格式预设设置，例如 `CSV`。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1733
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--fields <fields>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1738
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"An ordered list of fields to export. `*` includes all fields. Special\n"
"      symbol fields such as DNP or Exclude from board can be accessed with\n"
"      `${DNP}` or `${EXCLUDE_FROM_BOARD}`, respectively (see the\n"
"      xref:../eeschema/eeschema.adoc#text-variables[text variable documentation]\n"
"      for a list of fields). Default: \"Reference,Value,Footprint,${QUANTITY},${DNP}\"."
msgstr "要导出的字段的有序列表。`*` 表示导出所有字段。特殊符号字段（如 DNP 或 Exclude from board）可分别通过 `${DNP}` 或 `${EXCLUDE_FROM_BOARD}` 访问（参见 xref:../eeschema/eeschema.adoc#text-variables[文本变量文档] 以获取字段列表）。默认值：\"Reference、Value、Footprint、${QUANTITY}、${DNP}\"。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1739
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--labels <labels>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1741
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"An ordered list of labels to apply the exported fields (default:\n"
"      `\"Refs,Value,Footprint,Qty,DNP\"`)."
msgstr "应用导出字段的标签有序列表（默认值：`\"Refs,Value,Footprint,Qty,DNP\"`）。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1742
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--group-by <fields>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1743
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fields to group references by when field values match."
msgstr "当字段值匹配时，用于按字段分组引用。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1744
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--sort-field <fields>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1745
#, no-wrap
msgid "Field name to sort by (default: `\"Reference\"`)."
msgstr "按字段名称排序（默认：`\"Reference\"`）。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1746
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--sort-asc`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1747
#, no-wrap
msgid "If given, sort in ascending order. If not given, sort in descending order."
msgstr "如果指定了排序方式，则按升序排序。如果未指定排序方式，则按降序排序。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1748
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--filter <filter>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1749
#, no-wrap
msgid "Filter string to remove output lines."
msgstr "过滤字符串以移除输出行。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1751
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exclude symbols with the \"Do not populate\" attribute."
msgstr "排除具有 \"DNP\" 性的符号。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1752
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--include-excluded-from-bom`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1753
#, no-wrap
msgid "Include symbols marked \"Exclude from BOM\"."
msgstr "包含标记为 “从 BOM 中排除” 的符号。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1754
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--field-delimiter <delimiter>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1755
#, no-wrap
msgid "Separator between output fields/columns (default: `\",\"`)."
msgstr "输出字段/列之间的分隔符（默认：`\",\"`）。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1756
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--string-delimiter <delimiter>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1757
#, no-wrap
msgid "Character to surround fields with (none by default)."
msgstr "用于包围字段的字符（默认为空）。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1758
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--ref-delimiter <delimiter>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1759
#, no-wrap
msgid "Character to place between individual references (default: `\",\"`)."
msgstr "用于分隔各个位号之间的字符（默认：`\",\"`）。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1760
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--ref-range-delimiter <delimiter>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1762
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Character to place in ranges of references (default: `\"-\"`). Leave blank for\n"
"      no ranges."
msgstr "用于指定位号范围的字符（默认值：`\"-\"`）。若不指定范围，请留空。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1763
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--keep-tabs`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1764
#, no-wrap
msgid "Keep tab characters from input fields. Stripped by default."
msgstr "保留输入字段中的制表符。默认情况下会被移除。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1765
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--keep-line-breaks`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1766
#, no-wrap
msgid "Keep line break characters from input fields. Stripped by default."
msgstr "保留输入字段中的换行符。默认情况下会被移除。"

#. type: Title ===
#: cli.adoc:1768
#, no-wrap
msgid "Schematic DXF export"
msgstr "原理图 DXF 导出"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:1772
msgid "The `sch export dxf` command exports a schematic to a DXF file. Each sheet in the design is exported to its own file."
msgstr "命令 `sch export dxf` 将原理图导出到 DXF 文件。设计中的每张图纸都会导出到各自的文件中。"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:1774
msgid "Usage: `kicad-cli sch export dxf [--help] [--output OUTPUT_DIR] [--drawing-sheet SHEET_PATH] [--define-var KEY=VALUE] [--theme THEME_NAME] [--black-and-white] [--exclude-drawing-sheet] [--default-font VAR] [--pages PAGE_LIST] INPUT_FILE`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1789
#, no-wrap
msgid "Show help for the DXF file export command."
msgstr "显示 DXF 文件导出命令的帮助信息。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1793 cli.adoc:1922
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The output folder for the exported files. One file is output for each\n"
"      sheet. When `--output` is not used, the files are exported to the\n"
"      current directory."
msgstr "导出文件的输出文件夹。当未使用 `--output` 时，文件将导出到当前目录。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1796 cli.adoc:1871 cli.adoc:1925 cli.adoc:2002
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Path to drawing sheet to use in plot, overriding the drawing sheet\n"
"      specified in the schematic file."
msgstr "用于绘图的图框路径，覆盖原理图文件中指定的图框。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1802 cli.adoc:1877 cli.adoc:1931 cli.adoc:2008
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The name of the theme to use for export. If no theme is given, the\n"
"      schematic editor's currently selected theme is used."
msgstr "用于导出的主题名称。如果未指定主题，则使用原理图编辑器当前选择的主题。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1803 cli.adoc:1878 cli.adoc:1932 cli.adoc:2009
#, no-wrap
msgid "`-b`, `--black-and-white`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1804 cli.adoc:1879 cli.adoc:1933 cli.adoc:2010
#, no-wrap
msgid "Export schematic in black and white."
msgstr "以黑白形式导出原理图。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1805 cli.adoc:1880 cli.adoc:1934 cli.adoc:2011
#, no-wrap
msgid "`-e`, `--exclude-drawing-sheet`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1806
#, no-wrap
msgid "Plot DXF without a drawing sheet."
msgstr "在没有图框的情况下绘制 DXF。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1807 cli.adoc:1882 cli.adoc:1936 cli.adoc:2013
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--default-font <font name>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1808 cli.adoc:1883 cli.adoc:1937 cli.adoc:2014
#, no-wrap
msgid "Default font name. Default: `\"KiCad Font\"`."
msgstr "默认字体名称。默认值：`\"KiCad 字体\"`。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1809 cli.adoc:1892 cli.adoc:1940 cli.adoc:2017
#, no-wrap
msgid "`-p <page list>`, `--pages <page list>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1812 cli.adoc:1895 cli.adoc:1943 cli.adoc:2020
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Comma-separated list of pages to export. Blank or unspecified means all\n"
"      pages. To plot specific pages, give the root sheet as `INPUT_FILE` and\n"
"      specify the desired output pages with the `--pages` argument."
msgstr "以逗号分隔的要导出的页面列表。空白或未指定表示所有页面。要绘制特定页面，请将根页面作为 `INPUT_FILE` 指定，并使用 `--pages` 参数指定所需的输出页面。"

#. type: Title ===
#: cli.adoc:1814
#, no-wrap
msgid "Schematic netlist export"
msgstr "原理图网表导出"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:1819
msgid "The `sch export netlist` command exports a netlist in xref:../eeschema/eeschema.adoc#netlist-formats[various formats] from a schematic."
msgstr "命令 `sch export netlist` 将原理图中的网表以 xref:../eeschema/eeschema.adoc#netlist-formats[各种格式] 导出。"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:1821
msgid "Usage: `kicad-cli sch export netlist [--help] [--output OUTPUT_FILE] [--format FORMAT] INPUT_FILE`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1836
#, no-wrap
msgid "Show help for the netlist export command."
msgstr "显示网表导出命令的帮助信息。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1839
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The output filename. When `--output` is not used, the output filename\n"
"      will be the same as the input file, with a `.net` file extension."
msgstr "输出文件名。当未使用 `--output` 时，输出文件名将与输入文件相同，但文件扩展名为 `.net`。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1840
#, no-wrap
msgid "`-f <format>`, `--format <format>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1842
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The netlist output format. Options are `kicadsexpr` (default), `kicadxml`,\n"
"      `cadstar`, `orcadpcb2`, `spice`, `spicemodel`, `pads`, or `allegro`."
msgstr "网表输出格式。可选格式包括 `kicadsexpr`（默认）、`kicadxml`、`cadstar`、`orcadpcb2`、`spice`、`spicemodel`、`pads` 或 `allegro`。"

#. type: Title ===
#: cli.adoc:1844
#, no-wrap
msgid "Schematic PDF export"
msgstr "原理图 PDF 导出"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:1848
msgid "The `sch export pdf` command exports a schematic to a PDF file. Each sheet in the design is exported to its own page in the PDF file."
msgstr "`sch export pdf` 命令将原理图导出到 PDF 文件。设计中的每个图纸都会导出到 PDF 文件中的单独页面。"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:1850
msgid ""
"Usage: `kicad-cli sch export pdf [--help] [--output OUTPUT_FILE] [--drawing-sheet SHEET_PATH] [--define-var KEY=VALUE] [--theme THEME_NAME] [--black-and-white] [--exclude-drawing-sheet] [--default-font VAR] [--exclude-pdf-property-popups] [--exclude-pdf-"
"hierarchical-links] [--exclude-pdf-metadata] [--no-background-color] [--pages PAGE_LIST] INPUT_FILE`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1865
#, no-wrap
msgid "Show help for the PDF file export command."
msgstr "显示 PDF 文件导出命令的帮助信息。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1868
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The output filename. When `--output` is not used, the output filename\n"
"      will be the same as the input file, with a `.pdf` file extension."
msgstr "输出文件名。当未使用 `--output` 时，输出文件名将与输入文件相同，并带有 `.pdf` 文件扩展名。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1881
#, no-wrap
msgid "Plot PDF without a drawing sheet."
msgstr "绘制无图框的 PDF。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1884
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--exclude-pdf-property-popups`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1885
#, no-wrap
msgid "Do not generate property popups in PDF."
msgstr "请勿在 PDF 中生成属性弹出窗口。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1886
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--exclude-pdf-hierarchical-links`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1887
#, no-wrap
msgid "Do not generate clickable links for hierarchical elements in PDF."
msgstr "请勿为 PDF 中的层次结构元素生成可点击链接。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1888
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--exclude-pdf-metadata`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1889
#, no-wrap
msgid "Do not generate PDF metadata from AUTHOR and SUBJECT variables."
msgstr "请勿从 “作者” 和 “主题” 变量生成 PDF 元数据。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1890 cli.adoc:1938 cli.adoc:2015
#, no-wrap
msgid "`-n`, `--no-background-color`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1891 cli.adoc:1939 cli.adoc:2016
#, no-wrap
msgid "Export schematic without a background color, regardless of theme."
msgstr "无论主题如何，均以无背景色的形式导出原理图。"

#. type: Title ===
#: cli.adoc:1897
#, no-wrap
msgid "Schematic PostScript export"
msgstr "原理图 PostScript 导出"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:1901
msgid "The `sch export ps` command exports a schematic to a PostScript file. Each sheet in the design is exported to its own file."
msgstr "命令 `sch export ps` 将原理图导出到 PostScript 文件。设计中的每个图纸都会导出到各自的文件中。"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:1903
msgid ""
"Usage: `kicad-cli sch export ps [--help] [--output OUTPUT_DIR] [--drawing-sheet SHEET_PATH] [--define-var KEY=VALUE] [--theme THEME_NAME] [--black-and-white] [--exclude-drawing-sheet] [--default-font VAR] [--no-background-color] [--pages PAGE_LIST] "
"INPUT_FILE`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1918
#, no-wrap
msgid "Show help for the PS file export command."
msgstr "显示 PS 文件导出命令的帮助信息。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1935
#, no-wrap
msgid "Plot PS without a drawing sheet."
msgstr "在没有图框的情况下绘制 PS。"

#. type: Title ===
#: cli.adoc:1945
#, no-wrap
msgid "Schematic bill of materials export (legacy BOM scripts)"
msgstr "原理图 BOM 导出（旧版 BOM 脚本）"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:1952
msgid ""
"The `sch export python-bom` command exports an XML BOM file from a schematic.  The XML BOM file can then be processed into your desired BOM format using a custom script or one of the scripts described in the xref:../eeschema/eeschema.adoc#bom-"
"export[schematic BOM export documentation]."
msgstr "命令 `sch export python-bom` 可从原理图导出 XML BOM 文件。然后，可使用自定义脚本或 xref:../eeschema/eeschema.adoc#bom-export[原理图 BOM 导出文档] 中描述的脚本之一，将 XML BOM 文件处理成所需的 BOM 格式。"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:1954
msgid "Usage: `kicad-cli sch export python-bom [--help] [--output OUTPUT_FILE] INPUT_FILE`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1969
#, no-wrap
msgid "Show help for the BOM export command."
msgstr "显示 BOM 导出命令的帮助信息。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1973
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The output filename. When `--output` is not used, the output filename\n"
"      will be the same as the input file, with a `-bom.xml` suffix and file\n"
"      extension."
msgstr "输出文件名。当未使用 `--output` 时，输出文件名将与输入文件相同，并添加 `-bom.xml` 后缀和文件扩展名。"

#. type: Title ===
#: cli.adoc:1975
#, no-wrap
msgid "Schematic SVG export"
msgstr "原理图 SVG 导出"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:1979
msgid "The `sch export svg` command export a schematic to an SVG file. Each sheet in the design is exported to its own file."
msgstr "命令 `sch export svg` 将原理图导出到 SVG 文件。设计中的每个图纸都会导出到各自的文件中。"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:1981
msgid ""
"Usage: `kicad-cli sch export svg [--help] [--output OUTPUT_DIR] [--drawing-sheet SHEET_PATH] [--define-var KEY=VALUE] [--theme THEME_NAME] [--black-and-white] [--exclude-drawing-sheet] [--default-font VAR] [--no-background-color] [--pages PAGE_LIST] "
"INPUT_FILE`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:1999
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The output folder for the exported files. When `--output` is not used,\n"
"      the files are exported to the current directory."
msgstr "导出文件的输出文件夹。当未使用 `--output` 时，文件将导出到当前目录。"

#. type: Title ==
#: cli.adoc:2022
#, no-wrap
msgid "Symbol commands"
msgstr "符号命令"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:2026
msgid "The `sym` subcommand exports symbols to another format or upgrades symbol libraries to the current version of the KiCad symbol file format."
msgstr "`sym` 子命令用于将符号导出到另一种格式，或将符号库升级到 KiCad 符号文件格式的当前版本。"

#. type: Title ===
#: cli.adoc:2027
#, no-wrap
msgid "Symbol export"
msgstr "符合导出"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:2031
msgid "The `sym export svg` command exports one or more symbols from the specified library into SVG files."
msgstr "`sym export svg` 命令将指定库中的一个或多个符号导出为 SVG 文件。"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:2033
msgid "Usage: `kicad-cli sym export svg [--help] [--output OUTPUT_DIR] [--theme THEME_NAME] [--symbol SYMBOL] [--black-and-white] [--include-hidden-pins] [--include-hidden-fields] INPUT_FILE`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:2040
#, no-wrap
msgid "Symbol library file to use for export."
msgstr "用于导出的符号库文件。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:2048
#, no-wrap
msgid "Show help for the symbol SVG export command."
msgstr "显示 SVG 导出命令的帮助信息。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:2052
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The output folder for the exported files. Each symbol in the input library\n"
"      is output to a separate file. When `--output` is not used, the files\n"
"      are exported to the current directory."
msgstr "导出文件的输出文件夹。当未使用 `--output` 时，文件将导出到当前目录。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:2055
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The name of the theme to use for export. If no theme is given, the symbol\n"
"      editor's currently selected theme is used."
msgstr "用于导出的主题名称。如果未指定主题，则使用符号编辑器当前选定的主题。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:2056
#, no-wrap
msgid "`-s <symbol name>`, `--symbol <symbol name>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:2058
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The specific symbol to export from the library. When this argument is\n"
"      not used, all symbols in the library are exported."
msgstr "从库中导出的具体符号。当未使用此参数时，库中的所有符号均会被导出。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:2060
#, no-wrap
msgid "Export symbols in black and white."
msgstr "以黑白形式导出符号。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:2061
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--include-hidden-pins`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:2062
#, no-wrap
msgid "Export hidden pins in the exported SVG."
msgstr "在导出的 SVG 中导出隐藏引脚。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:2063
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--include-hidden-fields`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:2064
#, no-wrap
msgid "Export hidden symbol fields in the exported SVG."
msgstr "在导出的 SVG 文件中导出隐藏的符号字段。"

#. type: Title ===
#: cli.adoc:2066
#, no-wrap
msgid "Symbol upgrade"
msgstr "符号升级"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:2072
msgid ""
"The `sym upgrade` command converts the the specified symbol library from a legacy KiCad symbol format or a non-KiCad symbol format to the native format for the current version of KiCad. If the input library is already in the current file format, no action is "
"taken."
msgstr "`sym upgrade` 命令将指定的符号库从旧版 KiCad 符号格式或非 KiCad 符号格式转换为当前版本 KiCad 的原生格式。如果输入库已采用当前文件格式，则不执行任何操作。"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:2074
msgid "Supported input symbol formats are:"
msgstr "支持的输入符号格式包括："

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:2076
msgid "KiCad symbol library (`.kicad_sym`)"
msgstr "KiCad 符号库（`.kicad_sym`）"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:2077
msgid "KiCad (pre-6.0) symbol library (`.lib`)"
msgstr "KiCad（6.0之前版本）符号库（`.lib`）"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:2078
msgid "Altium schematic library (`.SchLib`)"
msgstr "Altium 原理图库（`.SchLib`）"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:2080
msgid "CADSTAR parts library (`.lib`)"
msgstr "CADSTAR 元件库（`.lib`）"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:2085
msgid "Usage: `kicad-cli sym upgrade [--help] [--output OUTPUT_FILE] [--force] INPUT_FILE`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:2092
#, no-wrap
msgid "Symbol library to upgrade."
msgstr "符号库升级。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:2100
#, no-wrap
msgid "Show help for the symbol upgrade command."
msgstr "显示符号升级命令的帮助信息。"

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:2103
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The output filename for the upgraded symbol library. When `--output` is\n"
"      not used, the upgraded symbol library is saved over the original library."
msgstr "升级后符号库的输出文件名。当未使用 `--output` 时，升级后的符号库将覆盖原始库。"

#. type: Title ==
#: cli.adoc:2107
#, no-wrap
msgid "Version commands"
msgstr "版本命令"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:2112
msgid "The `version` command prints the KiCad version. Without any arguments, it simply prints the version number, for example `7.0.7`. You can print the version in several other formats using the `--format` argument."
msgstr "`version` 命令用于显示 KiCad 的版本信息。若不带任何参数，它将直接显示版本号，例如 `7.0.7`。您还可以通过使用 `--format` 参数以其他格式显示版本信息。"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:2115
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use `kicad-cli version --format about` for version information to include\n"
"      when submitting bug reports or feature requests on Gitlab.\n"
msgstr "使用 `kicad-cli version --format about` 命令获取版本信息，并在提交 GitLab 上的 bug 报告或功能请求时包含此信息。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: cli.adoc:2117
msgid "Usage: `kicad-cli version [--help] [--format VAR]`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: cli.adoc:2129
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Format of the version number. Options are `plain` (default), `commit`, or\n"
"      `about`. `plain` prints the version number (e.g. `7.0.7`), which is the\n"
"      default if the `--format` argument is not used. `commit` prints the hash\n"
"      of the git commit for the build of KiCad you are using. `about` prints the\n"
"      full version information, including library versions and basic system\n"
"      information. You can use the `about` version information in bug reports."
msgstr "版本号的格式。可选项包括 `plain`（默认）、`commit` 或 `about`。`plain` 显示版本号（例如 `7.0.7`），这是在未使用 `--format` 参数时的默认格式。`commit` 打印您正在使用的 KiCad 构建的 Git 提交哈希值。`about` 打印完整的版本信息，包括库版本和基本系统信息。您可以在错误报告中使用 `about` 版本信息。"

